efault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-09-29T12:11:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T17:13:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in: v4.5.stable.official [876b29033], v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Linux Mint 22.2 (Zara) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (nvidia; 580.65.06) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8700K CPU @ 3.70GHz (12 threads) - 31.26 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using GPUParticles3D, using a toroidal mesh or other mesh that is lower in the middle than the outside, as the node to generate particle spawn points with the volume setting creates spawn points in the hole or lower geometry outside of the mesh volume. \n\nThe mesh being used for the volume:\n<img width=\"1728\" height=\"1327\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28a6c034-b8a2-49f7-b4e6-f493191fcf14\" />\n\nThe particles spawning at the created points:\n<img width=\"1791\" height=\"1184\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0155d85-50b0-4235-8950-a816e00d30f2\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create GPUParticles3D and  MeshInstance3D nodes.\n- Assign a toroidal mesh to the MeshInstance3D.\n- Give GPUParticles3D process_material and draw_pass_1 assets.\n- Generate GPUParticles3D emission points from volume of MeshInstance3D.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gpu-particle-3d-volume-bug-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22597148/gpu-particle-3d-volume-bug-project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111031/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}